            "value": "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. While Proxy Gauge is visible on screen and automatic refresh is on, the server checks Claude, Codex, Kimi and Devin accounts with their providers at this interval: Claude at most every 30 minutes, plans at most once a day. xAI and Google accounts, reset grants and reset credits are checked only when you choose Refresh limits. The widget and the menu bar never contact providers, and rate limits from a provider pause the checks for that account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off by default. While Proxy Gauge is visible on screen and automatic refresh is on, the server checks Claude, Codex, Kimi and Devin accounts with their providers at this interval: Claude at most every 30 minutes, plans at most once a day. xAI and Google accounts, reset grants and reset credits are checked only when you choose Refresh limits. The widget and the menu bar never contact providers, and rate limits from a provider pause the checks for that account."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Domyślnie wyłączone. Gdy Proxy Gauge jest widoczne na ekranie, a automatyczne odświeżanie włączone, serwer sprawdza konta Claude, Codex, Kimi i Devin u ich dostawców w tym odstępie: Claude najczęściej co 30 minut, plany najwyżej raz na dobę. Konta xAI i Google, granty resetów i kredyty resetów są sprawdzane tylko po wybraniu „Odśwież limity”. Widżet i pasek menu nigdy nie kontaktują się z dostawcami, a limit zapytań od dostawcy wstrzymuje sprawdzanie danego konta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only servers added with a management key can ask providers for limits.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only servers added with a management key can ask providers for limits."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tylko serwery dodane z kluczem zarządzania mogą pytać dostawców o limity."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Proxy Gauge": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Proxy Gauge"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Otwórz Proxy Gauge"
          }
        }
      }
